<title>USA: Field Aircraft sees profitable Q2.</title>
<headline>Field Aircraft sees profitable Q2.</headline>
<dateline>SIMI VALLEY, Calif. 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fields Aircraft Spares Inc said Friday it will be profitable in the second quarter.</p>
<p>Fields had previously told shareholders it did not expect a return to profitability until the third quarter.</p>
<p>The company said sales in the second quarter through June 13 have increased 104 percent over 1996 levels.</p>
